WEBVTT

00:00:00.921 --> 00:00:22.261
Step 1: Exercise the following scenario in the app and confirm it works:
The core shopper journey for Hearth &amp; Field, starting on the storefront (shop listing surface): a shopper browses the All products grid, filters to a category, and sorts the listing; they add one product to the cart directly from the listing grid and open another product's detail page to add it from there, confirming the cart badge updates with the items; then they open the cart, review the line items and adjust a quantity, apply the promo code shown on the storefront banner (WELCOME10) and verify the discount changes the total, and proceed through checkout paying with the saved card, verifying an order confirmation is shown. This exercises the store's primary end-to-end commerce flow — browse → product page → cart management → promo checkout — and fails if any link in that chain is broken.
